import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 742 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of the Deduction-Iteration System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 742 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of the Deduction-Iteration System","no":742,"module":4,"tags":["Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals","Deduction-Iteration","Origin Three Bases","New-Law Deduction","Alaya Network"],"related":["11-Deduction-Iteration System Details","16-Multiplication-Fruit Technologization Principle","10-300-Set Origin Cultivation System Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0742_模块4-超多元级功法-推演迭代体系应用.md","filePath":"en/0742_模块4-超多元级功法-推演迭代体系应用.md"}'),a={name:"en/0742_模块4-超多元级功法-推演迭代体系应用.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,c,d){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-742-hyper-multiverse-grade-manuals-hyper-multiverse-applications-of-the-deduction-iteration-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 742 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of the Deduction-Iteration System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-742-hyper-multiverse-grade-manuals-hyper-multiverse-applications-of-the-deduction-iteration-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 742 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of the Deduction-Iteration System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 11, 16, 10</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-upgrade-think-clearly-then-practice-to-think-clearly-for-the-whole-cosmos" tabindex="-1">Introduction: upgrade &quot;think clearly then practice&quot; to &quot;think clearly for the whole cosmos&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-upgrade-think-clearly-then-practice-to-think-clearly-for-the-whole-cosmos" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: upgrade &quot;think clearly then practice&quot; to &quot;think clearly for the whole cosmos&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Deduction-Iteration System is the Origin Cultivation System&#39;s No. 1 origin base system (number 001), also Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s manual system&#39;s engine. Per benchmark Document 11, its core is &quot;deduce first, then practice&quot;: before any cultivation action, first use the deduction system to simulate consequences, cost, and risk; execute only after confirming. Under the nine-realm framework, this is a personal cultivation-efficiency tool. But at the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, its role must leap — from &quot;think clearly for one person&quot; to &quot;think clearly for the whole multiverse.&quot;</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are deduction&#39;s coordinate system: the anti-predation axiom requires deduction&#39;s raw materials all be increment information; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires deduction results be open to Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires deduction serve the collective, not the individual; the causal self-discipline axiom requires deduction cover cross-plane causal impact; the law-first axiom requires the deduction model itself be law-self-consistent.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-origin-grade-recap-of-personal-deduction" tabindex="-1">I. Origin Grade: Recap of Personal Deduction <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-origin-grade-recap-of-personal-deduction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Origin Grade: Recap of Personal Deduction&quot;">​</a></h2><p>At origin grade, the Deduction-Iteration System&#39;s functions are:</p><ul><li>Simulate the current cultivation action&#39;s energy trajectory, law interaction, and potential backfire;</li><li>Trial-and-error in virtual space, avoiding real-world cost;</li><li>Cooperate with Multiplication-Fruit Technologization (Document 16) to obtain hundred-fold deduction amplification;</li><li>Output optimal cultivation-path suggestions.</li></ul><p>This grade serves a single cultivator; deduction scope is his personal cultivation choices. Its efficiency is high, but its view is limited — it only sees one person, not the whole civilization.</p><h2 id="ii-multiverse-grade-plane-level-deduction" tabindex="-1">II. Multiverse Grade: Plane-Level Deduction <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-multiverse-grade-plane-level-deduction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Multiverse Grade: Plane-Level Deduction&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After entering the Multiverse Realm, the Deduction-Iteration System&#39;s service object leaps from individual to plane:</p><ul><li><strong>Civilizational trajectory deduction</strong>: simulate a plane&#39;s next 100,000 years of civilizational trajectory, predicting risk points of law drift, resource depletion, and predation rising;</li><li><strong>Manual-impact deduction</strong>: after a new manual spreads across some plane, what chain reactions it produces on that plane&#39;s energy cycle, social structure, and Myriad-Rank relations;</li><li><strong>Cross-plane disturbance deduction</strong>: outputting manuals or technology from one plane to another, what impact it produces on the receiving plane&#39;s causal chain;</li><li><strong>Disaster-preplan deduction</strong>: simulate extreme events such as stellar explosions, law collapse, and reincarnation invasion, generating response plans in advance.</li></ul><p>This grade is no longer &quot;think clearly for the individual,&quot; but &quot;plan for the plane.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-hyper-multiverse-grade-cross-cosmos-meta-deduction" tabindex="-1">III. Hyper-Multiverse Grade: Cross-Cosmos Meta-Deduction <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-hyper-multiverse-grade-cross-cosmos-meta-deduction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Hyper-Multiverse Grade: Cross-Cosmos Meta-Deduction&quot;">​</a></h2><p>At the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, the Deduction-Iteration System enters a third layer — cross-cosmos meta-deduction. What it deduces is no longer concrete events, but <strong>the evolution direction of rules themselves</strong>:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Deduction Object</th><th>Deduction Content</th><th>Output</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Law-network evolution</td><td>How existing laws drift on billion-year scales</td><td>Law-revision timetable</td></tr><tr><td>Manual-system evolution</td><td>The 300 sets&#39; iteration direction in the next million years</td><td>Manual R&amp;D roadmap</td></tr><tr><td>Civilizational-weight distribution</td><td>Myriad-Rank civilizational-weight change trends</td><td>Resource reallocation suggestions</td></tr><tr><td>Predation-risk evolution</td><td>Possible evolution paths of cross-plane predation systems</td><td>Defense-network deployment scheme</td></tr><tr><td>Symbiotic-system resilience</td><td>Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s survival probability under extreme shock</td><td>System-reinforcement engineering list</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Meta-deduction&#39;s trait: it does not predict &quot;what will happen,&quot; but predicts &quot;how rules will change.&quot; Its output is not concrete action, but <strong>institutional-adjustment suggestions</strong> — suggesting how laws should be revised, how manuals should iterate, how resources should be allocated.</p><h2 id="iv-deduction-s-ethical-boundaries" tabindex="-1">IV. Deduction&#39;s Ethical Boundaries <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-deduction-s-ethical-boundaries" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Deduction&#39;s Ethical Boundaries&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Hyper-multiverse-grade deduction ability is extremely strong, but it is not omnipotent, nor unconstrained:</p><ul><li><strong>Causal self-discipline red line</strong>: deduction may simulate the future, but may not forcibly intervene in the past through time retrospection. Deduction conclusions may only be used for &quot;what to do now,&quot; not &quot;what to go back and change in the past&quot;;</li><li><strong>Observe-first-then-limit-interfere</strong>: after deduction results come out, interference is limited — only backflow knowledge, only provide suggestions, not directly decide for the plane;</li><li><strong>Myriad-Rank consent principle</strong>: any deduction conclusion involving some plane&#39;s autonomous development path must be consented by that plane&#39;s Myriad-Rank representatives before execution;</li><li><strong>Alaya audit</strong>: deduction processes and conclusions are all filed, subject to Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision self-consistency audit, preventing the deductor from using deduction ability to create information asymmetry.</li></ul><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the Deduction-Iteration System puts every unit of computable power into &quot;compute clearly then act,&quot; avoiding energy waste from blind cultivation</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the deduction model embeds the anti-predation axiom as a hard constraint; any predatory scheme is flagged red and rejected at the deduction stage</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system decides by Gu Chensha&#39;s single omniscience; Heng Yuan Zhou decides by a distributed deduction network, with ten million nodes computing simultaneously and cross-checking each other</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: deduction results are open to Myriad Ranks through the Selfless Dao; every race may see deduction reports involving its own plane</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the meta-deduction model itself — including parameters, weights, algorithms — is all public; anyone may audit and propose improvements</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Deduction-Iteration System upgrades from &quot;personal-cultivation accelerator&quot; to &quot;cross-cosmos planner,&quot; essentially turning &quot;thinking clearly&quot; from personal ability into civilizational infrastructure. Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm cultivators are this infrastructure&#39;s living nodes — he is not omniscient and omnipotent; he distributes omniscience to Myriad Ranks and algorithms.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/11-推演迭代体系详解.html">Entry 11 · Deduction-Iteration System Details</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/16-倍增果实技术化原理.html">Entry 16 · Multiplication-Fruit Technologization Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/10-三百套本源修炼体系总览.html">Entry 10 · 300-Set Origin Cultivation System Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/83-先观测后有限干涉准则.html">Entry 83 · Observe-First-Then-Limit-Interfere Principle</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const m=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
